.TH SWAYDESK-BRIGHTNESS-POPUP 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.4" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-brightness\-popup \- brightness and night light popup for Waybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-brightness\-popup
.SH DESCRIPTION
A brightness slider and the night light buttons. The sway\-brightness and sway\-nightlight helpers change the values; this popup only has the controls.
.PP
Running it again while the popup is open closes it, and opening it closes the other popups of the bar. Esc, clicking outside or switching workspace also closes it.
.PP
The session runs it under the name waybar\-brightness\-popup (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-brightness\-popup); the process name is waybar\-brightness\-popup too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR brightnessctl (1),
.BR gammastep (1),
.BR swaydesk (7)
